1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,023
Why would I deceive you?

2
00:00:02,373 --> 00:00:04,414
Where's the Truth Donut?

3
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:07,967
No idea. Why would I deceive you?

4
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:11,607
What's behind you?

5
00:00:11,627 --> 00:00:14,985
My backpack. Why would I deceive you?

6
00:00:16,785 --> 00:00:19,292
Just say you took it.

7
00:00:19,312 --> 00:00:22,303
I took... nothing. Why would I—

8
00:00:26,003 --> 00:00:29,403
Tell the truth. It shrinks.

9
00:00:29,553 --> 00:00:31,410
Fine. I took it.

10
00:00:32,203 --> 00:00:34,723
Did we learn something?

11
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:37,525
Yes. Why would I deceive you?
